{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "_comment": [
    "How the game sounds (WP-51). Read once at boot by InitializeAudio; an unknown id, a missing file or a missing entry stops the boot.",
    "cues: id -> files (one variant is picked per play, never the same one twice in a row), volume 0..1, pitch_jitter 0..0.25 (play pitch = 1 +/- jitter).",
    "skills: skill id (skills.json) -> release (when the caster's attack clip reaches its impact frame) and/or land (where the blow or projectile lands).",
    "skill_fallback: for a skill with no entry in `skills`: support = target ally/self, else by damage_type (physical | magical).",
    "events: the fixed moments the code plays. state_cues: played when that state becomes the top of the stack (not when returning from settings/compendium).",
    "music: looping track per place; the theme tracks play in that theme's battles, rewards and events; boss replaces the theme track in a boss battle.",
    "Files live under assets/audio and are made by tools/audio/synth.mjs (provenance: assets/audio/sources.json)."
  ],
